+---
+id: dl-005-refund-unused-rental-time-on-cancellation
+type: decision-log
+title: "Refund unused rental time on cancellation"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` must return the amount given back to a customer, but the request does not
+define how cancellation time affects that amount.
+
+## Decision
+
+Refund the price of the unused booking time. Cancelling before the booking starts refunds its full
+price; cancelling at or after its end refunds zero. For a cancellation during a rental, calculate
+the refund using the booking's existing daily or hourly rate for the remaining whole pricing units.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Cancellation time must use the same valid UTC, on-the-hour timestamp rules as rental boundaries.
+The service will retain cancellation state so a booking can be cancelled only once, while removed
+active bookings immediately stop affecting availability and overlap checks.
