+type: task
+title: "Add rental booking cancellation"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement `cancel(bookingId, at)` on the in-memory rental service. It must calculate a refund at
+the cancellation time, release the booked equipment, reject repeated cancellation, document the
+public API, and cover successful and invalid cancellation cases with deterministic tests.
